<figure class="fig11">
  <div class="scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 300" role="img" aria-label="A timeline of the Cloudflare outage of 2 July 2019, in UTC. At 13:42 a WAF rule is deployed everywhere, at 13:37 the build passes its tests, at 14:00 the WAF is named as the cause, at 14:07 it is switched off worldwide and at 14:09 CPU is back to normal. The roughly 27 minutes between deploy and recovery are drawn in red. The WAF is re-enabled at 14:52.">
    <text x="40" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Cloudflare, 2 July 2019: one regular expression on the request path (UTC)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cloudflare, 2/7/2019: một regular expression nằm trên đường đi của request (UTC)</tspan></text>
    <line x1="60" y1="170" x2="860" y2="170" class="ax" />
    <rect x="128" y="164" width="264" height="12" class="rbar" />
    <text x="260" y="152" class="r" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>about 27 min of core disruption</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>khoảng 27 phút dịch vụ lõi bị gián đoạn</tspan></text>
    <line x1="372" y1="66" x2="372" y2="164" class="lead" /><text x="372" y="60" class="t" text-anchor="start"><tspan data-lang-en>14:07  WAF switched off worldwide</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>14:07  tắt WAF trên toàn cầu</tspan></text>
    <line x1="128" y1="116" x2="128" y2="164" class="lead" /><text x="128" y="110" class="t" text-anchor="start"><tspan data-lang-en>13:42  WAF rule deployed everywhere</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>13:42  rule WAF được triển khai khắp nơi</tspan></text>
    <line x1="80" y1="176" x2="80" y2="209" class="lead" /><text x="80" y="215" class="t" text-anchor="start"><tspan data-lang-en>13:37  tests pass, build is green</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>13:37  test qua hết, build xanh</tspan></text>
    <line x1="392" y1="176" x2="392" y2="209" class="lead" /><text x="392" y="215" class="t" text-anchor="start"><tspan data-lang-en>14:09  CPU back to normal</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>14:09  CPU về bình thường</tspan></text>
    <line x1="304" y1="176" x2="304" y2="259" class="lead" /><text x="304" y="265" class="t" text-anchor="start"><tspan data-lang-en>14:00  WAF named as the cause</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>14:00  xác định WAF là nguyên nhân</tspan></text>
    <line x1="811" y1="176" x2="811" y2="209" class="lead" /><text x="811" y="215" class="t" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>14:52  WAF re-enabled</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>14:52  bật lại WAF</tspan></text>

  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Times from Cloudflare's own post-mortem. The CPU was spent inside one regular expression, on the request path of every machine.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Giờ lấy từ chính bài post-mortem của Cloudflare. CPU bị đốt bên trong một regular expression, ngay trên đường đi của request ở mọi máy.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

